function [current,rwalphas] = Control(BfieldNav,pqrNav,ptpNav,w123)
global IrR Jinv Bdot rwSATURATED DETUMBLE
global Ir1B Ir2B Ir3B n1 n2 n3
magtorquer_params

%%% BDOT CONTROLLER %%%
if DETUMBLE
    k = 67200; %%Activa los magnetopares en alguna de estas dos condiciones
    current = k*cross(pqrNav,BfieldNav)/(n*A); %%% current = gain * (angular velocity x magnetic field) / scale
elseif rwSATURATED
    % Reaction wheel desaturation
    Hrw = Ir1B*w123(1)*n1 + Ir2B*w123(2)*n2 + Ir3B*w123(3)*n3;
    k = 0.001;   % Gain de desaturacion [1/s]
    Bnorm2 = dot(BfieldNav,BfieldNav);
    if Bnorm2 > 0
        mu_desat = k*cross(Hrw,BfieldNav)/Bnorm2;
        current = mu_desat/(n*A);
    else
        current = [0;0;0];
    end
else
    current = [0;0;0]; %%Desactiva los magnetopares

end

%%% RW CONTROLLER %%%
%reaction_wheel_params
sumabspqrNav = sum(abs(pqrNav));
KP = eye(3)*1.0*IrR(1,1);
KD = eye(3)*45*IrR(1,1);
ptpcommand = [1;0;0];
pqrcommand = [0;0;0];

% Error de actitud y velocidad angular
attitudeError = ptpNav - ptpcommand;
rateError = pqrNav - pqrcommand;

% Momento deseado SOBRE EL SATELITE
Mdesired = -KP*attitudeError - KD*rateError;
if ~DETUMBLE
    if rwSATURATED
        % Momento generado por los magnetopares
        muB = current*n*A;
        LMN_MTQ = cross(muB,BfieldNav);
        % Las ruedas compensan el par de los magnetopares
        % para mantener el momento deseado del satelite
        rwalphas = Jinv*(LMN_MTQ - Mdesired);
    else
        % Control normal de actitud:
        % el par de la rueda sobre el satelite es -J*rwalphas
        rwalphas = -Jinv*Mdesired;
    end
else
    Mdesired = [0;0;0];
    rwalphas = [0;0;0];
end
if ~DETUMBLE && sumabspqrNav < 0.3 && (rwSATURATED == 1) && sum(abs(w123)) < 0.1
    rwSATURATED = 0;
    disp('Reaction wheels at zero and system detumbled')
end


